// "Draw(who)" ([CR#121.1]) — the bare-verb pattern TWIN: "whenever `who` draws"
// (the keyword-action intent — distinct from the RESULT-side `Drawn` filter a
// "drawn" trigger keys on, [CR#700.4]). Expands to the `Act` master form, the
// performer riding `who` (the fact's `actor`).
(
    name: "Draw",
    template: "${0} draws",
    kinds: [EventFilter],
    params: [Predicate],
    body: Act(verb: Draw, who: Param(0)),
)
